        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-26T13:51:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we can get away with not keeping them alive, since the `uniforms` array goes away at the end of this function. Alternatively, WDYT about adjusting this function signature to pass in the ShaderCodeDictionary so that it can look up the actual snippet and just access the existing cached uniforms?",
